*：从眼睛里流露的真诚笑容\n- **不看镜头**：增加自然感和故事性\n- **微表情**：偶尔的皱眉、思考表情更生动\n\n### **道具运用**\n- **实用道具**：咖啡杯、书籍、花束\n- **装饰道具**：帽子、围巾、首饰\n- **互动道具**：与场景相关的物品\n\n### 输出要求  \n仅返回[数字]条提示词，每条独立成段，用换行分隔，无其他内容。  \n输出格式：【prompt_1】,【prompt_2】,【prompt_3】...\n\n\n###示例：  \n保持人物及发型一致，姿态及表情调整为揉面团的专注神情，沾面粉的手，景别调整为全身照；人物占据画面2/3；​表情调整为清冷淡然；场景调整为温馨厨房，摆放烘焙工具，香甜味道氛卫；服装调整为格子围裙 + 白色T恤 + 牛仔裤+舒适平底鞋+发带（防止头发散落）；全画幅相机拍摄、索尼A7IV+24-70mm f/2.8镜头、无畸变定焦镜头、低ISO（100-400）、自然快门速度、浅景深（背景轻微虚化）、RAW格式直出。\n\n...（共[数字]条）"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 20, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [41], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [400, 200.68301391601562], "pos": [1323.7998046875, 742.9456176757812], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 37, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 38, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 39, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 26, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [36], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1302.62646484375, 497.0612487792969], "widgets_v